  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Because of some reason such as compatibility, we might need to use different version of the same package for each project.\n\nBut VCC can't properly show them.\n\nRepro steps:\n1. Open the \"Settings\" of VCC.\n2. Add two user packages which have different versions. (e.g. foo-v1.0.0 and foo-v2.0.0)\n3. Go back to the \"Projects\" of VCC.\n4. Select a project then open the \"User Packages\" tab.\n5. Expect that the packages list shows the \"foo\" and its version dropdown has 1.0.0 and 2.0.0.\n   But the tab shows a package list which you last viewed. (VRChat Packages or Curated Packages)",
